Hi,

There is a new release of the twclock program at 
http://wa0eir.ham.org

twclock can display the local time, GMT, and the 
current time at major cities around the world.  It
also has an ID timer that sends your call in CW via
the soundcard.  Just feed the soundcard output to 
your rig for an automatic station ID.

